1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
Buying something

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:05,240
Add what you want to your cart.

3
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:10,203
The cart icon counts what you’ve added. Open it to check.

4
00:00:10,203 --> 00:00:15,169
Here’s everything in your cart. When it looks right, check out.

5
00:00:15,169 --> 00:00:21,019
Enter your name and postcode.

6
00:00:21,019 --> 00:00:25,979
The overview shows how you’ll pay, the delivery, and the total with tax.

7
00:00:25,979 --> 00:00:28,822
Finish places the order.

8
00:00:28,822 --> 00:00:33,781
Done. This is a practice shop, so nothing is really sent or charged.

9
00:00:33,781 --> 00:00:36,500
That’s all there is to it.
